'''Chill''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by [[crafting]] it during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. To craft it, players needed a [[Heat]] [[File:Heatv2.png|25px|link=Heat]] and 100 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift2015}}.  It is now only obtainable through trading.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a black dragon breathing a bright blue flame. The guard represents the dragon’s head, and the handle is solid black with a neon blue paracord design over it. Attached to the bottom of the handle is the bright blue pointed flame pommel.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/105351503/Dragons-Blaze-Dagger Dragon's Blaze Dagger].
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 235 godly [[shards]].

